# Calculate tau (Yanai tissue/celltype specificity index) per gene across multiple scRNA-seq datasets
#
# This version REPLACES BOTH:
# 1) clustering functions: NO Seurat clustering (avoids Seurat internal issues)
# 2) MAIN LOOP: NO calls to cluster_with_seurat() / tau_from_seurat()
#
# Key bugfix (your traceback):
# - Matrix::cBind is DEFUNCT in Matrix >= 1.7.x
# - Replace do.call(Matrix::cBind, ...) with do.call(cbind, ...)  (base cbind works for dgCMatrix)
#
# Seurat is used ONLY for Read10X() IO convenience.

